{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/550475/", "pk": 550475, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/", "pk": 110654, "shortname": "sixfinscharter", "name": "Six Fins Boat Charter - Perry Marina", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Discover the Marquesas Keys", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 2, "unicode": "Discover the Marquesas Keys", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": 6, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "##Description\n\"Exploring the Marquesas: A Weekend of Adventure on the Gulf Stream\"\n\n##About\nHemingway's Playground -  Ernest’s first sportfishing foray was a weekend trip with Charles to the Marquesas, 30 miles offshore, on a boat captained by Bahamian “Bra” Saunders.  The possibilities are endless, from romantic sunsets, harbor trips, snorkeling, sandbar and dolphin cruises, and thrilling backwater eco excursions. Start times are flexible.\n\nChartering a boat to the Marquesas Keys in Florida for the day can offer a unique and memorable experience. Here are a few reasons why it might be a great choice:\n\n1. **Remote and Pristine Environment**: The Marquesas Keys are relatively remote and less crowded than other popular spots in the Florida Keys. This means enjoying a more tranquil and pristine environment, with beautiful, unspoiled beaches and clear waters.\n\n2. **Great for Wildlife Viewing**: The area is known for its diverse marine life. You might see dolphins, sea turtles, and a variety of bird species. It's a fantastic spot for nature enthusiasts and photographers.\n\n3. **Exceptional Snorkeling**: The waters around the Marquesas Keys are excellent for snorkeling and diving. The coral reefs and underwater ecosystems are vibrant and offer a chance to explore marine life up close.\n\n4. **Adventure and Privacy**: Since the Marquesas Keys are more isolated, you'll have a greater sense of adventure and privacy than in popular destinations. It's a perfect spot for a private getaway.\n\n5. **Scenic Beauty**: The keys offer stunning scenery, including mangroves, sandy beaches, and turquoise waters. It's an ideal setting for relaxation, exploration, and enjoying nature.\n\n6. **Fishing Opportunities**: If you're into fishing, the waters around the Marquesas Keys can provide excellent opportunities for catching various fish.\n\n7. **Personalized Experience**: Chartering a boat allows you to customize your itinerary to suit your interests and schedule, whether you want to spend more time snorkeling, exploring, or relaxing on the beach.\n\nOverall, a day trip to the Marquesas Keys by boat offers a unique blend of adventure, natural beauty, and relaxation.\n\n##Extra\nAll charter passengers may use The Perry Hotel and Marina Pools as my guests before and after the charter. David, Owner", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, Fl.", "booking_notes": "IMPORTANT ACTION REQUIRED\nSix Fins Charter – Discover the Marquesas Confirmation\n\nDear Guests,\n\nWe’re excited to welcome you aboard your Marquesas Keys Expedition — one of the most remote and spectacular private charters available from Key West.\n\nPlease review the important details below to ensure a smooth and unforgettable offshore adventure.\n\n✅ Before Your Charter\n\nFor trips up to six passengers:\n\n👉 Complete the insurance waiver: [here] (https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/rd9k5tiavpwper7h2rhaqh/web/)\n\nAND for trips with 7th and 8th passengers:\n\n👉 The primary renter (21+ years old) and captain must complete the Bareboat Agreement together at the dock before departure, but prior to arrival, you may begin: [here](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/ez5636zbxexwrng7dtz6mq/web/)\n\nAll forms must be completed prior to arrival.\n\n🌊 Your Offshore Expedition\n\nYou’ve reserved:\n\n8 Hours – $2,070\n10 Hours – $3,065\n\nThe Marquesas Keys are located approximately 30 miles offshore.\n\nThis charter may include:\n\n• Remote sandbar stops\n• Snorkeling\n• Wildlife viewing\n• Beach exploration\n• Optional fishing\n• Extended sunset return (10-hour option)\n\nTravel time is approximately 60–75 minutes each way.\n\n📍 Departure Details\n\nDock A, Slip #32\n7001 Shrimp Rd\nStock Island, FL 33040\n\nPlease arrive 15 minutes prior to departure.\n\n🩺 Health & Safety\n\nThis is an offshore charter.\n\nIf you are prone to seasickness, we strongly recommend preventative medication.\n\nThe captain may adjust itinerary based on weather and sea conditions.\n\n• Food allergies or dietary restrictions: reply to this email and let us know in advance so we can prepare.\n\n🎁 Complimentary Access\n\nAs my charter guests, you may enjoy access to The Perry Hotel & Marina pools and fitness center before and after your trip.\n\nWe look forward to taking you to one of the most extraordinary destinations in the Florida Keys.\n\nBest regards,\nDavid McFadden\nOwner, Six Fins Charter", "cancellation_notes": "Enjoy peace of mind with our cancellation policy:\n\nAll reservations made within 7 calendar days of departure are non-refundable. Customer cancellations made prior to 7 calendar days before departure will receive a full refund. If Six Fins Charter 